        "steam_appid": 3925220,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925220/extras/36867d24428bcf6ae2e33e0799d58770.poster.avif?t=1755948910\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925220/extras/36867d24428bcf6ae2e33e0799d58770.webm?t=1755948910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925220/extras/36867d24428bcf6ae2e33e0799d58770.mp4?t=1755948910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring Youmu Konpaku from Touhou Project! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this challenging physics-based game, you will have to precisely lift the cube against gravity and carefully navigate to the exit of each level without touching the walls or enemies. But this is easier said than done, due to the cube's high speed as well as enemies that will try to mess with you! Mechanics like Focus mode   and the Charged slash will prove useful, but expect to fail a lot. Fortunately, a lower-difficulty option is also available. Can you beat all 100 levels, with all sorts of different enemies &amp; mechanics scattered across the journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 levels, plus something extra at the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 worlds, each bringing their own challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight or escape from 17 different foes, each with their own behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of Animal Spirits to alter Youmu's abilities to complete levels</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925220/extras/36867d24428bcf6ae2e33e0799d58770.poster.avif?t=1755948910\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925220/extras/36867d24428bcf6ae2e33e0799d58770.webm?t=1755948910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925220/extras/36867d24428bcf6ae2e33e0799d58770.mp4?t=1755948910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring Youmu Konpaku from Touhou Project! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this challenging physics-based game, you will have to precisely lift the cube against gravity and carefully navigate to the exit of each level without touching the walls or enemies. But this is easier said than done, due to the cube's high speed as well as enemies that will try to mess with you! Mechanics like Focus mode   and the Charged slash will prove useful, but expect to fail a lot. Fortunately, a lower-difficulty option is also available. Can you beat all 100 levels, with all sorts of different enemies &amp; mechanics scattered across the journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 levels, plus something extra at the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 worlds, each bringing their own challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight or escape from 17 different foes, each with their own behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of Animal Spirits to alter Youmu's abilities to complete levels</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Youmu Konpaku has been turned into a cube! Help her escape by navigating her through 100 levels in this challenging physics-precision game inspired by the Ball Revamped flash game series! Also includes a lower-difficulty option for a less strict experience.",
